    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main action of the game takes place in Pennsylvania. The small town of Paintburgh was captured by mutant rats. They evolve and turn into dangerous monsters. The main protagonist, Jack, and his brother David try to survive in this environment. Jack wants to leave the town, but David finds a way to make money on someone else\u2019s misfortune.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344270/extras/b0b65b948b37fdf4efad1544c18962c8.poster.avif?t=1755032465\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344270/extras/b0b65b948b37fdf4efad1544c18962c8.webm?t=1755032465\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344270/extras/b0b65b948b37fdf4efad1544c18962c8.mp4?t=1755032465\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jack Street is a dark 2D action-platformer. The exciting adventure with horror elements is inspired by cartoons of the 90s and 2000s.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight different types of mutants and bosses. Try to survive and uncover the secrets of a dark town.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344270/extras/36f94ca633f9fb0b50ef946f36886a0b.poster.avif?t=1755032465\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344270/extras/36f94ca633f9fb0b50ef946f36886a0b.webm?t=1755032465\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344270/extras/36f94ca633f9fb0b50ef946f36886a0b.mp4?t=1755032465\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main protagonist Jack is not a typical superhero or just a good person. He is a rude introvert who achieves his own goals, however there is something wonderful in his inner world.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet some characters and interact with them to learn something new, but don't trust anyone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore different and dangerous locations. Discover the dark side of the town.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The original and atmospheric soundtrack!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344270/extras/d82001f051107b84d0bd556e39c980ea.poster.avif?t=1755032465\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344270/extras/d82001f051107b84d0bd556e39c980ea.webm?t=1755032465\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344270/extras/d82001f051107b84d0bd556e39c980ea.mp4?t=1755032465\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Our team of like-minded people consists of:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Daniil Veselov - Game Designer, writer, programmer, concept artist </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alexis Wong - Senior background artist\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I\u00fari Andrade - Composer, Sound designer</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Filip Gronowski - Animator</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
